Package: krb5keytab
Architecture: any
Depends: libkrb5admin-perl (>= 0.4.3-1), ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Kerberos keytab management helper
 krb5keytab provides a privileged helper and Perl client for installing,
 changing, listing, querying, testing, and generating Kerberos keytabs through
 the krb5_admin framework.
